Z||000008||Eric||08-25-2000||10:32 PM||||I think fender flares are the way to go.  I always thought that body kit was missing a little something, and after seeing those big ass tires sticking out I know what it is.  The damn think is too narrow in the rear.  In order to achieve a really exotic look, the car should have a wide rear pawprint.  Of course the work would be too hard to do this to one car, but what about modifying the molds?  I envision an '80s Tesstarosa shaped side, naturally, with more roundness.||||reg||3
